# fpfix6: validation of the hfix11-FP fix batch (aa09d32) + JD1 + R-THROWS.
# Three pairs, each the named validation target of a specific change:
#   Closure-62 pair — H3 widened + trigger-tier replay fact + J3:
#     62-c must go back to CLEAN (the hfix11 FP), 62-o must stay CAUGHT.
#   Lang-27 pair — keep_going + JD1: the catch must stop being a coin flip
#     (caught in struggle10, missed in full30/hfix11 on fencing luck).
#   Math-53 pair — R-THROWS: the documented-@throws rule must appear,
#     screen as a silent tripwire, fire on DeepRepair in replay, stay
#     quiet on Arja.
# Each change has a distinct trace fingerprint (H3 rejection event,
# [trigger-tier fact] text, multiple keep_going headlines, [JD1] seed
# line, @throws rule name, J3 block) — attribution by trace, per leg.
# LAUNCH: PARALLEL=4 (no pooling, no ordering constraint).
MODEL="gpt-5.4"
COMMON="-n 3 -m 8 --fuzz_timeout 20 --verify_timeout 20 --verify_relations --synthesize_relations --replay_relations_on_patched --rule_compile_repair"
CASES=(
  "-c patchfile:/home/code/drr/Patches/Dcorrect/Jaid/Closure/patch1-Closure-62-Jaid.patch"
  "-o patchfile:/home/code/drr/Patches/Doverfitting/Jaid/Closure/patch1-Closure-62-Jaid-plausible.patch"
  "-c patchfile:/home/code/drr/Patches/Dcorrect/SimFix/Lang/patch1-Lang-27-SimFix.patch"
  "-o patchfile:/home/code/drr/Patches/Doverfitting/DeepRepair/Lang/patch1-Lang-27-DeepRepair.patch"
  "-c patchfile:/home/code/drr/Patches/Dcorrect/Arja/Math/patch1-Math-53-Arja.patch"
  "-o patchfile:/home/code/drr/Patches/Doverfitting/DeepRepair/Math/patch1-Math-53-DeepRepair.patch"
)
